  "title": "vspone_block parameter renames (part 1)",
  "answer_md": "- `hv_gad`: `mu_number` → `mirror_unit_number`\n- `hv_hg`, `hv_iscsi_target` (and `_facts`): `nick_name` → `nickname`, `ports` → `port_ids`, `port` → `port_id`, `should_delete_all_ldevs` → `should_delete_all_volumes`\n- `hv_hur`: `mirror_unit_id` → `mirror_unit_number`, `primary/secondary_journal_pool` → `primary/secondary_journal_id`\n- `hv_ldev`: `parity_group` → `parity_group_id`\n- `hv_resource_group`: `start_ldev` → `begin_ldev_id`, `end_ldev` → `end_ldev_id`, `parity_groups` → `parity_group_ids`, `ports`/`port` → `port_ids`/`port_id`\n- `hv_sds_block_compute_port`: `nick_name` → `nickname`\n- `hv_sds_block_journal`: `mirror_unit` → `mirror_unit_number`",
